ai offered a new visual language visible in the framing of this scene.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw10","target":"aw42","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"Manet's groundbreaking depiction of modern urban leisure provided a crucial precedent for the Impressionists' focus on contemporary social life, moving away from historical or mythological subjects.","direction":"outgoing"}],"lineage":{"influenced_by":["aw10","aw10","aw10","aw10","aw10"],"influences":[]},"stats":{"total_connected":5,"influences_count":3,"influenced_count":2,"filter":"all","vault_count":0,"beyond_count":5}}